<title>INDIA: India Mata  MATASEC sees bond yield at 10.87 pct.</title>
<headline>India Mata  MATASEC sees bond yield at 10.87 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Money market dealer Mata Securities said it recommended bids at 10.87 percent or lower at an auction of four-year government stock later on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;There is good demand in the market for 4-year paper,&quot; the firm said in its recommendation.</p>
<p>&quot;Bid at 10.87 percent or lower,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
